  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PGS/PMRS and GCMHP - Gaza Graffiti</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">PGS/PMRS och GCMHP</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Huvudsyftet med insatsen &#xe4;r att st&#xe4;rka den palestinska befolkningens  r&#xe4;tt till h&#xe4;lsa och d&#xe4;rmed deras m&#xf6;jlighet att delta som avktiva      medlemmar i samh&#xe4;llet samt att minska deras utsatthet f&#xf6;r fattigdom.  St&#xf6;det kanaliseras via PGS till tv&#xe5; palestinska organisationer. PMRS  erbjuder billig och kvalitativ prim&#xe4;rh&#xe4;lsov&#xe5;rd medan GCMHP arbetar    kurativt och preventivt med psykisk h&#xe4;lsa.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims at enhancing the Palestinaian&apos;s right to health and  thereby their ability to participate as active members in the society and to reduce their vulnerability to poverty. The support is          channelled thorugh PGS to two local Palestinian organisations. PMRS   provides quality, low cost primary health care services while GCMHP   works both curative and preventive with mental health.</narrative>
  </description>
